// CROWN — a two-edge body row: `f() + g()` chases to no single terminal,
// so the first form of the exit check (a chase to NRowFree) never fired
// for it; the install walks EVERY free terminal of the resolved row and
// the second argument refuses. Accepted by boot 2974547b (exit 8). Expect
// E_EffectMismatch.
effect E { op() -> Int }
handler h { op() => resume(7) }
fn both(f, g) with !E = f() + g()
fn main() = (both(() => 1, () => op())) ~> h
